      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds okay but i think the terms might be a bit too complex for 12 year olds. can u actually write out a specific outline for a lesson? maybe focusing on how the revolutionary/progressive side is usually the one trying to fix big problems in society, whereas the regressive side is mostly just resisting those fixes. can u make sure the lesson plan emphasizes that distinction?",
